  fhir:ValueSet.description [ fhir:value "Qualitative findings recorded at a gaze position: sensory responses on the red\nfilter plus light and Worth 4 dot tests (fusion, suppression of one eye, crossed or\nuncrossed diplopia) and the position of the corneal light reflex on the Hirschberg test\n(centered, or displaced nasally, temporally, superiorly or inferiorly in the eye assessed).\nThe binding is extensible, so other findings (e.g. tropia vs phoria on a prism cover test)\nmay be used when no concept here applies."] ;
